    As I did in Esther http://www.lojban.org/tiki/Esther , I think the key
here is to use "prali", rather than "vamji" in these type of constructions
"The film is well worth seeing" ->  lo nu catlu lo skina cu te prali [lo'e
prenu/do] .  Of course, in this case, it's also "lo nu lo skina cu xamgu
[lo'eprenu/do]"

        --gejyspa



